{"unit_id":"wuzeno__dsh-inline-attachments#card-zh","repo":"wuzeno/dsh-inline-attachments","commit":"82e7d4b6d99112718591f2386caa4af757ab43e4","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Inline Attachments 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的行内附件插件：它把图片或文件作为紧凑标签插入正在编辑的句子，并在发送后保留文字与附件的对应位置。插件通过 DSH 原生输入附件队列和引用序列化接入，支持从文件选择器、拖放或粘贴添加附件，也可在光标位置重新插入标签。图片标签可悬停查看预览并点击放大，历史消息会把引用还原为标签；文件沿用原生上传流程。适合需要在长消息中明确说明每份素材用途的用户。无需额外 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:72-91","src/client.js:175-209","src/history.js:43-72"]}
{"unit_id":"wuzeno__dsh-inline-attachments#card-en","repo":"wuzeno/dsh-inline-attachments","commit":"82e7d4b6d99112718591f2386caa4af757ab43e4","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Inline Attachments places file and image chips at the current cursor in the DSH web composer. Add files by picker, drag-and-drop, or paste; image chips offer hover and expanded previews, and sent messages retain inline references. No extra API key or external service is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:72-91","src/client.js:175-209","src/history.js:43-72"]}
